      "beats": [
        {
          "zone": "continuation",
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Mimi confirms another activity is planned in the meeting area. The reminder of who checks the schedule is unclear. How could one small suggestion help?",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 11480
        },
        {
          "zone": "concern",
          "index": 1,
          "text": "State the factual concern and confirmed schedule. No blame, patient data or invented savings. Separate what is known from what is still unknown.",
          "start_ms": 11780,
          "end_ms": 21980
        },
        {
          "zone": "proposal",
          "index": 2,
          "text": "Mimi proposes reviewing whether a short meeting-end checklist is needed. Check the existing process first. This is a proposal, not an instruction to implement immediately.",
          "start_ms": 22280,
          "end_ms": 35520
        },
        {
          "zone": "reason",
          "index": 3,
          "text": "The reason: clearer schedule checks and handover. Verify time, materials and service needs. Mimi does not promise approval, repairs or a savings amount.",
          "start_ms": 35820,
          "end_ms": 49380
        },
        {
          "zone": "followup",
          "index": 4,
          "text": "Confirm responsibility and authority. Agree who will review, what to check and when to speak again. Review first; no new checklist while a decision is pending.",
          "start_ms": 49680,
          "end_ms": 62840
        },
        {
          "zone": "summary",
          "index": 5,
          "text": "Practice: a concern, one proposal and reason, local checks and follow-up. Protect service. Workplace skill is observed separately; online completion alone is insufficient.",
          "start_ms": 63140,
          "end_ms": 76540
        }
      ],
